_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Time-Speed-Distance", "sub": "basic-tsd", "key_answer": "4"}, {"n": 26, "text": "A number is first increased by 12%, and the increased number is decreased by 8%. Find the net increase or decrease percentage.", "options": [{"text": "2.08% increase", "added": false}, {"text": "2.08% decrease", "added": false}, {"text": "3.04% increase", "added": false}, {"text": "3.04% decrease", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Percentage", "sub": "successive-change", "key_answer": "3.04% increase"}, {"n": 27, "text": "If the radius of the base of a right circular cylinder is decreased by 24% and its height is increased by 262%, then what is the percentage increase (closest integer) in its volume?", "options": [{"text": "91%", "added": false}, {"text": "109%", "added": false}, {"text": "83%", "added": false}, {"text": "137%", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Mensuration 3D", "sub": "cylinder", "key_answer": "109%"}, {"n": 28, "text": "A retailer sold a laptop at ₹27,000 by giving two continuous rebates of 20% and 10%. What is the marked price?", "options": [{"text": "₹36,000", "added": false}, {"text": "₹37,500", "added": false}, {"text": "₹36,500", "added": false}, {"text": "₹37,000", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Discount", "sub": "mp-sp-relation", "key_answer": "₹37,500"}, {"n": 29, "text": "Two numbers are in the ratio 7 : 8. If the HCF is 4, find the greater number.", "options": [{"text": "8", "added": false}, {"text": "56", "added": false}, {"text": "32", "added": false}, {"text": "28", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "HCF-LCM", "sub": "hcf-lcm-of-numbers", "key_answer": "32"}, {"n": 30, "text": "If A can complete a job in 15 days and B can complete the same job in 20 days, then how many days (rounded up to the nearest two decimal places) will it take for both A and B to complete the job together?", "options": [{"text": "6.99 days", "added": false}, {"text": "9.01 days", "added": false}, {"text": "8.57 days", "added": false}, {"text": "7.25 days", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Time-Work", "sub": "together-apart", "key_answer": "8.57 days"}, {"n": 31, "text": "Anil can do a piece of work in 4 hours. Ashok can do it in 8 hours. With the assistance of Robin, they completed the work in 2 hours. In how many hours can Robin alone do it?", "options": [{"text": "10", "added": false}, {"text": "7", "added": false}, {"text": "8", "added": false}, {"text": "9", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Time-Work", "sub": "together-apart", "key_answer": "8"}, {"n": 32, "text": "A shopkeeper has announced 14% rebate on the marked price of an article. If the selling price of the article is ₹688, then the marked price of the article will be:", "options": [{"text": "₹600", "added": false}, {"text": "₹500", "added": false}, {"text": "₹700", "added": false}, {"text": "₹800", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Profit-Loss", "sub": "basic-cp-sp", "key_answer": "₹800"}, {"n": 33, "text": "At what rate percentage per annum (correct to one place of decimal) will ₹17,280 amount to ₹23,520 in 2 years, if the interest is compounded annually?", "options": [{"text": "16.7%", "added": false}, {"text": "15.9%", "added": false}, {"text": "16.4%", "added": false}, {"text": "15.4%", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Percentage", "sub": "basic-percentage", "key_answer": "16.7%"}, {"n": 34, "text": "Three partners invested in a business in the ratio 1:9:8. They invested their capitals for 11 months, 6 months and 2 months, respectively. What was the ratio of their profits?", "options": [{"text": "12:54:16", "added": false}, {"text": "8:54:16", "added": false}, {"text": "11:54:16", "added": false}, {"te